        "Pharmaceutical rigor meets OTC accessibility",
        "In gold-standard clinical food trials*—standards rarely seen and never required in supplements— Bōndia dramatically reduced bone loss in women with osteopenia, elevated BMI, or higher body fat composition (three groups most at risk for fragility fractures related to bone loss).",
        "Our randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled results and ongoing Harvard Medical School partnership reflect one truth: every part of our process is built on uncompromising science.",
        "*Bōndia is more than a dietary supplement—it’s a medical food, held to higher FDA safety and efficacy standards, yet accessible without a prescription or artificially inflated pharmaceutical pricing."
